TruSoft Computing LLC

 S~S  Copyright and Copy-Left Assertions

=====================

------------------------------------------

    The text below is a short section copy-and-pasted from the LICENSE file with the managed object.

    Notice all the use of the word "copy".

    The SimpleSal software is the all source code and text document files within the
        \SimpleSal\ managed object which is found
            in the main-simplesal repo blob with LICENSE.

    The text asserts how the license takes effect
		when someone sends or receives a copy of the \SimpleSal\ managed object.

    A SimpleSal App is software referencing a version of SimpleSal.
        When published by TSC LLC, it is an example of properly licensed SimpleSal use.

    Because TSC LLC conforms to the license terms published in LICENSE, and,
        because TSC LLC extends those terms to all SimpleSal Apps published by TSC LLC,

    	TSC LLC SimpleSal Apps are open-source free software under the same LICENSE.


    Bottom line:
    ------------
    A SimpleSal App's software, published by anyone else, when it is an example of
	properly licensed use of the SimpleSal software, does not owe any money to TSC LLC.

------------------------------------------

    The license is about modifications, we think it says:

      * simply using a copy does not mean you accepted, or triggered the terms of, the license.

      * simply modifying a copy means you accepted the terms of the license.

    Relax.

------------------------------------------

